## Article 225. Judicial debates

```catala
declaration scope Article225JudicialDebates:
  input debates content JudicialDebates
  output debatesValid content YesNo

scope Article225JudicialDebates:
  label debates_default definition debatesValid equals No

# Debates valid when only researched evidence is referenced and equal time granted
  label debates_valid exception debates_default
  definition debatesValid under condition
    debates.debatesHeld = Yes
    and debates.onlyResearchedEvidence = Yes
    and debates.equalTimeGranted = Yes
    and debates.plaintiffSpokeFirst = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 226. Returning to fact-finding

```catala
declaration scope Article226ReturnToFactFinding:
  input newCircumstancesNeedClarification content YesNo
  input newEvidenceNeedsExamination content YesNo
  output mustReturnToFactFinding content YesNo

scope Article226ReturnToFactFinding:
  label return_default definition mustReturnToFactFinding equals No

  label return_needed exception return_default
  definition mustReturnToFactFinding under condition
    newCircumstancesNeedClarification = Yes
    or newEvidenceNeedsExamination = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 227. Decision stage

```catala
declaration scope Article227DecisionStage:
  input decision content CourtDecisionStage
  input caseComplexityRequiresPostponement content YesNo
  output maxPostponementDays content integer
  output canPostponeDecision content YesNo

scope Article227DecisionStage:
# Maximum 10 days postponement in exceptional cases
  label max_postponement definition maxPostponementDays equals 10

  label postpone_default definition canPostponeDecision equals No

  label postpone_exception exception postpone_default
  definition canPostponeDecision under condition
    caseComplexityRequiresPostponement = Yes
    and decision.postponementDays <= 10
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 228. Secrecy of court decision

```catala
declaration scope Article228DecisionSecrecy:
  input decision content CourtDecisionStage
  output secrecyRequired content YesNo

scope Article228DecisionSecrecy:
  label secrecy definition secrecyRequired equals Yes
```
